        "thread_id": "TH1",
        "thread_goal": "Align on MVP scope, key workflows, and initial backlog for the support portal.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M1",
            "speaker_id": 337175,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, let's get started on the Unified Support Portal. The main goal is to have a working MVP ready for pilot in 21 days. First step is to define the core features. I've created a basic tracking sheet in A3 to keep us aligned. My focus will be on the backend services, starting with T3.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3",
              "T3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "rocket",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 561396,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Great to start! For the front-end, I think a simple agent dashboard and a customer FAQ page are the most important parts. I can start putting together some initial wireframes for T2 and T4 right away.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T2",
              "T4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 6869,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "Hi everyone. Before we jump into solutions, it's critical we map out the agent workflows. The biggest issue today is having to switch between three different screens to get a full picture of a customer's issue. The MVP must solve this. I'll start documenting these requirements for T1 in A1.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T1",
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "point_up",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 109718,
            "reply_to": "M3",
            "text": "That's a good point, @6869. For T3, I'll need to know exactly which customer data fields are required for that main dashboard view. Also, do we know which of the existing ticketing system APIs are stable enough to use for the MVP?",
            "mentions": [
              6869
