            "speaker_id": 337175,
            "reply_to": "M7",
            "text": "Okay, let's formalize the MVP features based on this. Proposal for D1: 1. A unified agent dashboard showing customer and ticket history. 2. Basic ticket creation from within the portal. 3. A panel with searchable knowledge base suggestions. Does that sound right for our 21-day target?",
